{"summary":"Journey through a colorful and action packed world in this one finger flinger!","description":"Ordia is a one finger platformer where you play as a new life form taking its first leaps into a strange and hazardous world.\n\nJump, bounce, stick and slide your way through rich and vibrant environments. Guiding each creature to safety in a primordial world packed with various perils, challenges and surprises! \n\nWith 30 levels to complete, plus extra challenge modes, bonus levels and achievements to unlock Ordia is a unique and challenging game with hours of gameplay.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n- Simple one-finger controls\n- 30 levels set across 3 worlds\n- Action packed platformer\n- Extra challenge modes for each level\n- Bonus levels and achievements to unlock\n\n<b>Winner in the 2019 Google Indie Contest!</b> 🏆\n\n\"All in all, Ordia is a hell of a game. It’s absolutely gorgeous, the animations are buttery smooth, and the sound effects and haptic feedback are incredibly satisfying\"  - <b>TouchArcade</b>\n\n\"Ordia is a truly special platformer that knows exactly what it’s supposed to be\" - <b>148Apps</b>\n\n\"A perfectly put together package for both casual platformer fans and enthusiasts alike\"  - <b>AppSpy</b>","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QZ-L4gmbCDw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O-_pRxADpeDZlthc8booY2q_WMx7t1bY3POtfE64tEXmEdbNQdIo1_9j3JnKh8guqDxkFfdHdGxv8OrgMyrhLA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r67FyaB6YQT4Fh9TIONnXRd62xIDw2JiIxarnSd7uX8kRStehwqThy_GsC5m6-APn-wkLG-nJzsEBj8wyBIHmg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/psAgFxhIaSQRNuMgSwSUo-NUWWRadYxGY_IXPS0_3K3nCWpsnXOedwLh2784V-dBjdm2i1MVO3E14jKJ8Hz6","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8SSJEYDXyfjPy5HPMHSIkEw3cQE89px-Xvwb7PwNOE9kGNvXiDWFQxMhcjAIzaMEhj65Esj8TcJ42reUIliJSw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Tqwx9aRyBXGh_00k0A-2HJLQvy7qqAswJfDfY86oObEjjdM